WEBVTT

01:40.300 --> 01:44.160
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.090 --> 01:47.200
[Episode 33]

02:03.560 --> 02:04.350
Barrier?

02:10.960 --> 02:11.870
Someone is coming.

02:18.030 --> 02:18.910
Open the barrier.

02:18.970 --> 02:19.900
Let them in.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.470
Listen to me.

02:37.880 --> 02:38.670
Go and take a look.

02:52.470 --> 02:53.280
Yuanzhong?

02:55.310 --> 02:56.120
Tanghua?

03:02.800 --> 03:04.000
After we left Yandu,

03:04.000 --> 03:05.080
we came to find you.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.840
How did you find us?

03:08.240 --> 03:09.910
We heard news of you from the human race.

03:10.150 --> 03:11.470
Zhi Dai brought us here.

03:20.280 --> 03:21.520
Dingxu is not dead.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.910
I guess he's lucky.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.590
You killed Baili Xiang

03:25.610 --> 03:26.530
and were then rescued.

03:27.730 --> 03:29.130
He must have been scared out of his wits

03:29.360 --> 03:30.630
and fled back to Fangwai Mountain overnight.

03:31.150 --> 03:32.110
I've already sent Jiuguang and some others back

03:32.110 --> 03:33.120
to keep watch.

03:33.430 --> 03:34.280
If anything happens,

03:34.310 --> 03:35.560
I'll know.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.560
And what about the War Demons?

03:42.870 --> 03:44.240
That day, I passed out from exhaustion

03:44.520 --> 03:45.520
and was captured.

03:45.870 --> 03:47.240
I don't know where they went.

03:47.590 --> 03:48.240
But I doubt

03:48.240 --> 03:49.400
they'd give up so easily.

03:49.630 --> 03:51.470
They'll definitely try to keep hunting you down while you're still badly injured.

03:51.630 --> 03:52.310
Didn't you encounter them

03:52.310 --> 03:53.520
on your way here?

03:53.840 --> 03:54.870
We encountered them once.

03:54.960 --> 03:56.240
I dumped them.

03:58.500 --> 04:00.250
Miss Ji, you really have remarkable skills.

04:01.080 --> 04:02.150
In the blink of an eye, you tossed Yandu

04:02.150 --> 04:03.150
to the Chili Mountain area,

04:03.150 --> 04:04.240
which is hundreds of miles away.

04:04.840 --> 04:06.240
With such godlike skills,

04:06.680 --> 04:08.000
a few War Demons

04:08.420 --> 04:09.900
were naturally no big deal to you.

04:15.310 --> 04:16.390
That's not a problem.

04:16.870 --> 04:18.240
With our abilities,

04:18.720 --> 04:20.310
even if the three races join forces again to attack us,

04:20.310 --> 04:21.160
we can hold them off.

04:22.440 --> 04:23.830
But that goddess...

04:24.920 --> 04:26.270
Why did she want to kill you?

04:41.240 --> 04:42.830
Will she come again?

04:43.159 --> 04:45.000
Will she send others to come this time,

04:45.300 --> 04:47.010
or will she do it on her own?

04:47.950 --> 04:49.310
Have you thought about these things?

04:50.270 --> 04:51.270
No need to think too much.

04:51.920 --> 04:52.920
If she comes again,

04:53.040 --> 04:54.159
I'll face her head-on.

04:54.430 --> 04:55.920
Plenty of people want me dead.

04:56.600 --> 04:58.120
A god like her won't make a difference.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.190
You have guts.

05:06.750 --> 05:07.750
I haven't thanked you yet.

05:08.000 --> 05:09.240
That day, you appeared like a warrior descended from heaven,

05:09.360 --> 05:10.310
with extraordinary combat prowess.

05:10.830 --> 05:11.920
Even your chief

05:11.920 --> 05:13.070
was no match for you.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.750
After your enlightenment,

05:14.790 --> 05:15.470
you must have already

05:15.490 --> 05:16.890
reached the stage of the Perfect War Demon, right?

05:18.430 --> 05:19.270
No need to thank me.

05:19.670 --> 05:20.750
I wasn't doing it for you.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.360
Curly, we haven't seen each other in years.

05:28.600 --> 05:29.950
Aren't you happy to see an old friend?

05:30.230 --> 05:31.670
Who's your old friend?

05:31.770 --> 05:32.409
I don't make friends

05:32.440 --> 05:34.000
with a crybaby.

05:36.540 --> 05:37.780
Who's a crybaby?

05:40.570 --> 05:41.530
They're not

05:41.560 --> 05:42.800
all going to stay here, are they?

05:42.830 --> 05:43.600
There aren't enough rooms

05:43.600 --> 05:44.560
or blankets here.

05:44.600 --> 05:47.270
And there's a War Demon.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.720
I can't see War Demons.

05:48.720 --> 05:49.480
I'll break out in rashes

05:49.480 --> 05:50.270
if I see them.

05:50.270 --> 05:51.430
We'll leave soon.

05:52.510 --> 05:53.240
Yandu still

05:53.240 --> 05:54.159
needs Zhi Dai to return

05:54.159 --> 05:55.070
to take charge of the situation.

05:55.630 --> 05:57.000
And I have to hurry back to Fangwai Mountain.

05:57.920 --> 05:58.920
Now that I see you're safe,

05:59.270 --> 06:00.360
I'm relieved.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.120
There's no rush to leave.

06:02.870 --> 06:03.800
At least tomorrow,

06:04.160 --> 06:05.800
you can have a drink at our wedding

06:05.800 --> 06:06.600
before you go.

06:29.720 --> 06:30.750
That's not a problem.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.560
With our abilities,

06:32.600 --> 06:34.190
even if the three races join forces again to attack us,

06:34.190 --> 06:35.000
we can hold them off.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.360
But that goddess...

06:38.480 --> 06:39.720
Why did she want to kill you?

06:48.920 --> 06:49.800
What is it?

06:50.430 --> 06:51.680
Are you really going to marry him?

06:55.180 --> 06:56.170
Do you even like him?

07:00.400 --> 07:00.990
Forget it.

07:01.680 --> 07:02.870
I already know the answer.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.160
But about that matter,

07:04.390 --> 07:05.430
do you have an answer now?

07:06.360 --> 07:07.160
What matter?

07:07.360 --> 07:08.160
Yuanzhong.

07:08.600 --> 07:09.950
Did he really fall into demonic ways?

07:10.750 --> 07:12.120
Was the goddess in the clouds

07:12.630 --> 07:13.720
trying to kill him because he has

07:13.720 --> 07:15.040
fallen into demonic ways?

07:15.390 --> 07:17.120
Since you don't trust him so much,

07:17.430 --> 07:18.630
why did you help him?

07:20.680 --> 07:22.630
Well, there's no conclusion yet, right?

07:22.750 --> 07:23.950
If he had died like that,

07:24.480 --> 07:25.870
you would have definitely been heartbroken.

07:31.920 --> 07:33.159
I can assure you

07:33.680 --> 07:35.240
that Yuanzhong has definitely not fallen into demonic ways.

07:35.680 --> 07:36.390
What happened before

07:36.390 --> 07:37.750
must have been a misunderstanding.

07:38.070 --> 07:39.120
Perhaps

07:39.120 --> 07:40.390
he was lost for a while,

07:40.560 --> 07:41.830
but he came to his senses

07:42.000 --> 07:43.190
just before going too far.

07:46.070 --> 07:47.870
As for that goddess in the clouds…

07:48.920 --> 07:49.720
I know.

07:50.270 --> 07:51.120
Don't worry.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.560
I'll take care of it.

07:54.920 --> 07:55.720
That's good.

07:56.430 --> 07:57.240
By the way,

07:57.800 --> 07:58.480
there's something

07:58.480 --> 07:59.680
I want to ask you.

07:59.680 --> 08:00.480
What is it?

08:01.410 --> 08:02.560
On the journey recently,

08:02.950 --> 08:03.870
have you encountered

08:03.870 --> 08:05.600
any strange people or events?

08:07.160 --> 08:08.190
Why do you ask that?

08:08.870 --> 08:10.270
I just feel that Miss Zhi Dai

08:10.270 --> 08:11.310
is a little off.

08:11.600 --> 08:12.680
Even the way she looked at me

08:12.680 --> 08:13.800
was a bit strange.

08:14.270 --> 08:15.800
What's so strange about that?

08:16.120 --> 08:17.510
In the blink of an eye,

08:17.510 --> 08:18.740
you tossed Yandu City to the mountains

08:18.770 --> 08:20.680
hundreds of miles away.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.040
Such a magical skill

08:22.120 --> 08:23.160
is godlike.

08:25.430 --> 08:26.240
Now,

08:26.270 --> 08:28.030
people are saying that you are also a god.

08:28.320 --> 08:30.120
She is just an ordinary person.

08:30.190 --> 08:31.000
Seeing you,

08:31.120 --> 08:32.200
she would naturally be scared.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.590
Have you made up your mind?

08:54.080 --> 08:54.870
Where are you?

08:56.320 --> 08:57.200
Come out!

08:58.030 --> 08:58.960
I'm a god.

08:59.540 --> 09:00.900
Gods are everywhere.

09:02.510 --> 09:05.120
You're not a god. You're a devil!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.390
It seems you still can't

09:06.390 --> 09:07.320
make up your mind.

09:07.750 --> 09:09.550
What? Are you really not afraid?

09:10.030 --> 09:11.480
He has fallen in love with you.

09:11.630 --> 09:12.670
But do you think

09:12.960 --> 09:15.000
that if he sees you old,

09:15.000 --> 09:16.440
with white hair and wrinkled skin,

09:16.790 --> 09:18.120
he would still love you the same?

09:18.120 --> 09:19.960
I will never let you control me.

09:20.270 --> 09:21.390
How foolish.

09:22.030 --> 09:23.670
You think you can fight against me?

09:26.550 --> 09:27.840
I'd rather die

09:28.600 --> 09:30.200
than let you get your way!

09:57.360 --> 09:58.910
Actually, what Dingxu said that day

10:00.000 --> 10:01.440
wasn't entirely a lie.

10:02.910 --> 10:03.640
I know.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.870
Then why did you help me?

10:11.240 --> 10:12.150
What's the big deal

10:12.150 --> 10:13.300
about wanting to destroy this world?

10:13.600 --> 10:14.240
During the years

10:14.240 --> 10:15.600
you were locked under Tianqu Peak,

10:15.780 --> 10:16.540
I thought about it

10:16.570 --> 10:17.930
many times every day.

10:18.510 --> 10:19.440
Sometimes I wanted to set a fire

10:19.440 --> 10:20.510
and burn down Fangwai Mountain,

10:21.080 --> 10:22.960
and sometimes I wanted to poison Dingxu,

10:23.270 --> 10:24.480
then skin him, tear out his bones,

10:24.720 --> 10:25.720
and throw him out of the mountain gate.

10:26.750 --> 10:27.960
But they were just thoughts.

10:28.910 --> 10:29.910
In this world, we judge a person

10:30.120 --> 10:31.320
based on their actions, not their thoughts.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.550
If just having bad thoughts

10:32.550 --> 10:33.600
would lead to judgment,

10:34.030 --> 10:35.320
none of us would be alive.

10:37.870 --> 10:39.510
But what if I really do that?

10:41.200 --> 10:42.390
I've told myself

10:42.840 --> 10:43.510
that in this life,

10:43.510 --> 10:45.000
I can only let you down once.

10:59.440 --> 11:01.030
Do you know who Ji Tanyin is?

11:01.870 --> 11:03.030
That day, when she came to save you,

11:03.240 --> 11:04.440
she threw Yandu hundreds of miles away

11:04.440 --> 11:05.790
in the blink of an eye.

11:06.340 --> 11:07.020
Some say

11:07.050 --> 11:08.960
she has divine magic that can move mountains and seas,

11:09.270 --> 11:10.910
while some say Yandu

11:10.910 --> 11:12.080
is just a giant Linglong House.

11:13.150 --> 11:14.960
Ji Tanyin is a top-tier craftsman.

11:15.480 --> 11:16.200
She might even be

11:16.200 --> 11:17.600
the creator of Yandu.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.200
No matter what,

11:19.630 --> 11:20.390
she's definitely not

11:20.390 --> 11:21.720
an ordinary person.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.480
You want to marry her?

11:24.510 --> 11:25.840
Do you really know her?

11:28.630 --> 11:29.910
I don't need to know her.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.720
I just need to know

11:32.390 --> 11:33.480
that she loves me,

11:34.470 --> 11:35.470
and that's enough.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.510
Tanghua,

11:38.840 --> 11:39.870
do you know

11:39.870 --> 11:40.840
what the first thought

11:41.600 --> 11:42.600
that flashed through my mind was

11:42.600 --> 11:44.240
when I woke up that day?

11:45.000 --> 11:45.790
What was it?

11:46.600 --> 11:47.910
I was glad that I didn't stand by

11:47.910 --> 11:49.600
and watch Chiyi and Xiazhi die.

11:50.870 --> 11:51.670
Why?

11:56.870 --> 11:58.200
When I woke up,

11:59.390 --> 12:00.790
Tanyin was right by my side.

12:12.630 --> 12:13.670
Looking at her,

12:15.390 --> 12:16.750
I quickly replayed my life

12:16.750 --> 12:17.790
in my mind.

12:18.550 --> 12:19.840
Then I felt relieved.

12:20.390 --> 12:21.510
I told myself

12:22.960 --> 12:23.750
that I was lucky.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.510
Luckily, I had

12:25.510 --> 12:26.720
a crazy plan.

12:27.910 --> 12:28.960
Luckily, I once thought about

12:28.960 --> 12:30.510
bringing the whole world to the grave.

12:32.320 --> 12:34.350
Luckily, I didn't kill anyone prematurely.

12:35.150 --> 12:36.080
I stopped

12:36.080 --> 12:37.960
before I committed

12:38.270 --> 12:39.390
any unforgivable sins.

12:40.910 --> 12:42.750
If I had really been covered in blood,

12:44.150 --> 12:45.600
with sins all over me,

12:46.720 --> 12:48.200
she wouldn't have fallen in love with me.

12:49.120 --> 12:50.910
and she wouldn't have stayed by my side.

12:52.150 --> 12:52.960
I'm so lucky.

12:54.150 --> 12:55.080
Thank goodness.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.200
I didn't expect it.

13:10.240 --> 13:11.630
Who would have expected it?

13:12.550 --> 13:14.120
That day, when I was at the end

13:14.790 --> 13:16.320
of my rope on the street of Yandu,

13:17.390 --> 13:18.720
she descended from the sky.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.550
At that moment,

13:23.000 --> 13:24.480
I suddenly realized

13:25.670 --> 13:26.550
that she was the gift

13:26.550 --> 13:27.750
given to me by heaven.

13:28.810 --> 13:30.380
It was precisely because she was so precious

13:31.270 --> 13:32.110
that heaven made me

13:32.110 --> 13:33.910
go through so many trials.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.240
Fortunately, I made it through.

13:38.670 --> 13:39.480
So,

13:40.150 --> 13:41.550
I must keep her.

13:44.000 --> 13:44.910
No one can

13:44.910 --> 13:46.200
take her away from me.

13:47.710 --> 13:48.710
No one.

13:55.360 --> 13:56.150
Alright.

13:57.080 --> 13:58.480
Just get married to Miss Ji

13:59.550 --> 14:00.600
and live a good life.

14:01.430 --> 14:03.040
Live a comfortable and happy life!

14:04.390 --> 14:05.870
And get back all the grievances

14:06.320 --> 14:08.200
you've suffered these years from that damn heaven.

14:08.910 --> 14:09.960
No one

14:09.960 --> 14:11.440
can disturb your good life.

14:11.670 --> 14:12.720
Not Dingxu,

14:13.120 --> 14:14.390
not the War Demons,

14:14.750 --> 14:16.600
and not even the gods in heaven.

14:18.260 --> 14:19.420
Whoever tries to make trouble for you,

14:20.390 --> 14:21.720
I'll fight them with my life.

14:26.000 --> 14:27.670
Then you'd better practice.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.440
I don't think

14:29.630 --> 14:30.960
you can even beat Qian Lin now.

14:32.240 --> 14:33.720
Don't mention that strange brat.

14:41.000 --> 14:42.150
Let me tell you.

14:42.960 --> 14:44.320
How many years have I practiced?

14:45.080 --> 14:46.550
How old is that brat?

14:47.150 --> 14:48.870
Just because he's a War Demon,

14:49.390 --> 14:50.910
I can't beat him.

14:51.120 --> 14:51.910
Why?

14:53.240 --> 14:54.030
Don't worry.

14:54.840 --> 14:55.750
Sooner or later...

14:56.270 --> 14:57.840
Sooner or later, I'll beat him up.

15:00.410 --> 15:02.530
Beat him up...

16:04.510 --> 16:06.550
Someone asked me to bring you a message.

16:07.480 --> 16:08.270
She said

16:08.750 --> 16:10.200
you would be able to tell

16:10.200 --> 16:11.440
if it's a lie.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.030
That person said

16:16.400 --> 16:18.280
Ji Tanyin is not an ordinary person;

16:19.240 --> 16:21.120
she is a goddess.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.750
You know?

16:30.600 --> 16:32.600
She is Goddess Wushuang,

16:33.520 --> 16:36.240
the creator of the Divine Left Hand.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.670
He once trained two students

16:41.670 --> 16:43.120
with high reputations.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.840
One of them is Goddess Wushuang,

16:44.840 --> 16:45.870
who has ascended and is now a god.

16:50.720 --> 16:51.390
Just treat me as

16:51.390 --> 16:52.790
a god's image hanging on the wall.

16:52.790 --> 16:53.750
I can always bless you

16:53.750 --> 16:54.840
and bring you good luck.

16:55.150 --> 16:56.510
She came to your side

16:56.610 --> 16:58.780
to take the Divine Left Hand from you

16:59.120 --> 17:01.440
and return it to the supreme god of the Divine Realm,

17:01.600 --> 17:03.000
Deity Taihe.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.720
I will stay by your side,

17:04.720 --> 17:06.069
until the moment you die.

17:07.180 --> 17:08.450
You must not leave me.

17:08.920 --> 17:10.440
Don't ask about my past.

17:11.310 --> 17:12.160
Absolutely, absolutely

17:12.190 --> 17:13.560
do not fall in love with me.

17:15.349 --> 17:16.750
High Priest Yuanzhong,

17:17.240 --> 17:18.589
she came to your side

17:18.750 --> 17:20.230
to wait for your death.

17:21.710 --> 17:23.430
She doesn't love you.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.440
I saw your future.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.030
By then,

18:09.830 --> 18:11.000
you will have white hair but a youthful face,

18:12.550 --> 18:13.720
surrounded by your children and grandchildren.

18:14.060 --> 18:17.170
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

18:15.350 --> 18:16.550
You will be full of kindness and ease,

18:17.240 --> 18:21.150
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

18:18.000 --> 18:19.070
joy and peace.

18:20.030 --> 18:23.400
You will grow old together with one person.

18:21.380 --> 18:24.080
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

18:24.690 --> 18:28.220
♫Awaiting what's lost to be regained♫

18:25.240 --> 18:26.640
And many others will envy you.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.400
In the end,

18:28.660 --> 18:31.560
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

18:29.480 --> 18:30.830
you will find fulfillment

18:31.890 --> 18:35.990
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

18:31.960 --> 18:34.160
and live a life that, when you look back on it,

18:34.160 --> 18:35.920
is filled with endless happiness.

18:36.140 --> 18:41.670
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

18:37.960 --> 18:39.440
But with whom will I

18:40.960 --> 18:42.070
spend a fulfilling life?

18:43.350 --> 18:46.390
♫If our promise♫

18:46.420 --> 18:49.590
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

18:50.470 --> 18:53.690
♫If fate leads us astray♫

18:53.710 --> 18:57.390
♫Life and death become our bond♫

18:57.610 --> 19:00.840
♫Storms heal with time♫

19:00.960 --> 19:05.810
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

19:05.960 --> 19:11.320
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

19:13.340 --> 19:19.380
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

21:07.880 --> 21:08.960
So beautiful!

21:12.160 --> 21:13.270
Have you seen Yuanzhong?

21:15.840 --> 21:17.160
I'll go out and take a look.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.750
What's wrong? Where's Yuanzhong?

21:30.000 --> 21:31.200
I haven't seen him all morning.

21:31.680 --> 21:32.470
I looked all around outside,

21:32.470 --> 21:33.270
but I couldn't find him.

21:33.310 --> 21:34.480
How come?

21:34.480 --> 21:35.920
Today is his wedding day.

21:35.920 --> 21:37.070
Where could he have gone?

21:37.350 --> 21:38.750
Is there any other barrier

21:38.750 --> 21:39.960
in your Fragrant House

21:39.960 --> 21:40.550
that leads to

21:40.550 --> 21:41.720
somewhere we don't know about?

21:44.400 --> 21:45.200
What should we do?

21:45.200 --> 21:46.510
It's almost time.

21:46.680 --> 21:48.160
Where did he go?

21:48.880 --> 21:49.720
I'll go look for him again.

21:49.790 --> 21:50.590
Miss Ji.

21:51.200 --> 21:52.070
Don't worry.

21:52.470 --> 21:53.800
Yuanzhong must have had something urgent to do.

21:54.100 --> 21:55.300
He should be back soon.

22:02.550 --> 22:03.730
You know where he is?

22:08.720 --> 22:09.610
I don't.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.070
You met him last night.

22:11.960 --> 22:13.150
What did you tell him?

22:17.510 --> 22:19.270
Why are you so afraid of me this time?

22:20.360 --> 22:20.880
I'm not.

22:20.900 --> 22:21.750
You're lying!

22:23.070 --> 22:23.880
Miss Ji.

22:23.920 --> 22:25.160
Is there any misunderstanding?

22:25.350 --> 22:26.110
Zhi Dai came here with me

22:26.110 --> 22:27.080
all the way from Yandu.

22:27.130 --> 22:28.330
She is definitely not your enemy.

22:34.700 --> 22:35.500
Zhi Dai!

22:42.100 --> 22:43.300
Who sent you here?

22:46.550 --> 22:47.160
Tell me!

22:50.750 --> 22:52.120
Goddess of Embroidery.

23:08.750 --> 23:09.590
Ji Tanyin,

23:10.510 --> 23:11.480
come and find me.

24:36.000 --> 24:36.880
You're here.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.960
Zi Fei told me

24:44.730 --> 24:46.860
that Xie You has two outstanding disciples.

24:47.680 --> 24:49.350
One is the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain,

24:50.870 --> 24:51.740
and the other one

24:53.030 --> 24:54.400
is Goddess Wushuang.

24:56.070 --> 24:57.480
I guessed half of the truth

24:59.050 --> 25:00.640
but overlooked the other.

25:08.440 --> 25:09.790
Ever since I can remember,

25:11.030 --> 25:11.750
this jade token

25:11.750 --> 25:13.350
has always been with me.

25:14.400 --> 25:16.200
I treat it as a protective charm

25:18.030 --> 25:19.510
and have been worshiping it.

25:21.160 --> 25:22.640
We of the Youhu Clan,

25:23.070 --> 25:24.350
once we take human form,

25:24.350 --> 25:25.510
we forget everything from before.

25:26.960 --> 25:27.640
So...

25:37.120 --> 25:38.270
it's yours,

25:39.510 --> 25:40.310
right?

25:41.650 --> 25:43.280
Back then, I was seriously injured

25:45.720 --> 25:47.110
and frozen in Wu Mountain.

25:49.390 --> 25:50.740
It was you who awakened me

25:52.750 --> 25:54.640
and took away this half of the jade token.

25:56.990 --> 25:58.840
So, we've known each other for a long time.

26:03.110 --> 26:05.310
The goddess I met in my youth

26:06.920 --> 26:07.830
was also you?

26:10.400 --> 26:11.070
Yes.

26:16.720 --> 26:17.790
So it's fate.

26:24.210 --> 26:25.860
No wonder you didn't kill me.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.200
No, Yuanzhong.

26:35.700 --> 26:36.870
I didn't kill you

26:37.570 --> 26:38.480
because I knew

26:38.480 --> 26:39.520
you were a good person.

26:39.680 --> 26:40.880
You don't deserve to die.

26:42.670 --> 26:43.560
A good person?

26:52.090 --> 26:53.000
A good person?

26:56.110 --> 26:57.000
Ji Tanyin,

26:59.030 --> 27:00.480
do you really know me?

27:01.920 --> 27:04.430
I've never been a good person.

27:06.620 --> 27:07.750
When I was young,

27:09.240 --> 27:10.830
I was competitive and ambitious,

27:11.590 --> 27:13.590
eager to stand out

27:13.590 --> 27:14.790
and make a name for myself.

27:14.790 --> 27:16.400
After obtaining the Divine Hand,

27:16.830 --> 27:18.400
I became greedy for success.

27:18.830 --> 27:20.510
In just the Battle of Pinghu alone,

27:22.000 --> 27:23.350
many War Demons

27:23.350 --> 27:24.700
were killed by me.

27:25.550 --> 27:27.330
Later, I was set up by my clan.

27:28.000 --> 27:29.720
I got sealed and imprisoned.

27:29.940 --> 27:31.680
I spent 40 years under Tianqu Peak,

27:31.680 --> 27:33.110
without seeing the light.

27:33.720 --> 27:35.350
I became a sinister

27:35.550 --> 27:36.770
and vicious devil,

27:37.680 --> 27:39.920
bent on revenge.

27:41.000 --> 27:42.160
You must have heard

27:42.160 --> 27:43.830
my prayer that day, right?

27:44.270 --> 27:45.980
I wanted to destroy this world.

27:46.160 --> 27:48.350
I wanted to drag everyone down to their deaths.

27:48.830 --> 27:49.880
Could someone like me

27:52.550 --> 27:54.030
be a good person?

27:54.480 --> 27:55.270
No.

27:55.900 --> 27:57.580
But you didn't do it, Yuanzhong.

27:58.310 --> 27:59.400
You're not...

28:00.250 --> 28:02.410
That's because you are too kind.

28:02.750 --> 28:05.240
You're so kind that it's terrifying.

28:05.640 --> 28:06.640
You're so kind

28:06.640 --> 28:08.310
that you once wanted me to stay away from you

28:08.310 --> 28:09.880
and even wanted me to kill you.

28:11.960 --> 28:13.240
Because I was afraid

28:13.240 --> 28:15.000
that I might be swayed because of you.

28:16.500 --> 28:18.310
Those who have been in the abyss for too long

28:19.660 --> 28:21.830
shouldn't bask in the sun.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.790
The sun is too warm,

28:28.960 --> 28:31.400
and it makes one yearn.

28:41.480 --> 28:43.620
But I was still enlightened by you.

28:45.310 --> 28:47.030
I developed desires

28:49.640 --> 28:51.160
and wanted to be with you.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.640
I wanted you to love me.

28:52.790 --> 28:54.110
I thought if I

28:54.110 --> 28:54.880
fell in love with this world,

28:54.880 --> 28:56.240
you would fall in love with me.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.740
But now that I've fallen in love with this world,

29:02.110 --> 29:03.830
you still don't love me.

29:05.390 --> 29:06.280
No, Yuanzhong.

29:08.200 --> 29:08.680
Yuan...

29:13.400 --> 29:14.480
No?

29:15.270 --> 29:16.920
Am I wrong?

29:17.720 --> 29:18.850
Do you love me?

29:19.720 --> 29:20.510
I...

29:34.170 --> 29:36.060
I'll always be with you.

29:39.870 --> 29:43.200
♫Going through thousands of years♫

29:43.830 --> 29:47.010
♫In exchange for a dreamlike love♫

29:46.290 --> 29:47.440
Be with me?

29:47.850 --> 29:50.520
♫If the wind is all yours♫

29:50.340 --> 29:52.260
Then wait for me to die

29:50.940 --> 29:54.940
♫No bitterness in your expression♫

29:53.730 --> 29:55.010
and take this

29:55.460 --> 29:58.440
♫Everyone comes without a match♫

29:56.350 --> 29:58.350
to save your god?

29:58.700 --> 30:03.260
♫Why are they willing to be gentle?♫

30:02.270 --> 30:04.640
Why do you have to go through all this trouble?

30:03.430 --> 30:06.490
♫The moment your image appeared in my eyes♫

30:05.310 --> 30:06.720
No, Yuanzhong.

30:07.120 --> 30:10.240
♫The answer appeared♫

30:09.310 --> 30:11.880
Yuanzhong, please let me explain.

30:11.110 --> 30:14.490
♫But time♫

30:14.920 --> 30:18.330
♫Always hides the waves and smoke♫

30:17.830 --> 30:18.920
What's wrong with you?

30:18.840 --> 30:22.710
♫Under the clouds, the good days♫

30:19.960 --> 30:21.480
What's wrong with you, Yuanzhong?

30:23.070 --> 30:26.710
♫Come and go in a flash♫

30:23.350 --> 30:24.920
What's wrong? What's wrong with you?

30:25.030 --> 30:26.000
Ji Tanyin.

30:28.580 --> 30:32.210
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

30:28.680 --> 30:30.270
I can't keep you anymore.

30:30.880 --> 30:31.750
No!

30:32.550 --> 30:36.000
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

30:33.550 --> 30:34.830
Where is your wound?

30:34.830 --> 30:36.030
Where is your wound?

30:36.030 --> 30:37.510
Hurry up and use the Divine Hand

30:36.410 --> 30:40.280
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

30:37.750 --> 30:39.160
to stop the bleeding!

30:39.880 --> 30:41.200
Hurry up, Yuanzhong!

30:40.480 --> 30:43.780
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

30:43.160 --> 30:44.690
I've let you go.

30:44.300 --> 30:47.530
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

30:44.710 --> 30:46.440
No, no!

30:47.030 --> 30:48.070
I've let you go.

30:48.070 --> 30:48.790
No!

30:48.240 --> 30:51.860
♫When I can only look back at you♫

30:52.280 --> 30:56.090
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

30:56.120 --> 31:00.830
♫I'll go no matter what♫

31:10.920 --> 31:12.030
No!

31:21.000 --> 31:21.830
