32:28.060 --> 32:33.370
♫I'll go no matter what♫

32:47.160 --> 32:47.960
Let's go.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.160
Yuanzhong!

33:47.550 --> 33:48.350
Yuanzhong!

33:54.440 --> 33:55.240
Yuanzhong!

33:57.200 --> 33:58.000
Yuanzhong!

33:59.450 --> 34:00.620
Divine Left Hand?

34:01.160 --> 34:02.480
What happened?

34:02.960 --> 34:03.750
Yuanzhong!

34:04.270 --> 34:05.070
Yuanzhong!

34:05.680 --> 34:06.680
Ji Tanyin!

34:06.920 --> 34:08.280
Who on earth are you?

34:10.440 --> 34:11.440
Answer me!

34:15.670 --> 34:16.480
Tanyin.

34:18.590 --> 34:19.400
Qian Lin,

34:20.840 --> 34:21.790
take care of him.

34:39.389 --> 34:41.020
In the Divine Realm, there are two kinds of gods.

34:41.360 --> 34:42.880
One type practices benevolent laws,

34:42.960 --> 34:44.150
cultivates virtues,

34:44.440 --> 34:46.280
and accumulates immeasurable magical power over countless lifetimes,

34:46.590 --> 34:48.230
ultimately reaching complete enlightenment through contribution.

34:49.110 --> 34:50.070
Both Hannv and I

34:50.070 --> 34:51.710
brought benefit to the people through our skills,

34:51.880 --> 34:53.400
and with this merit, we ascended to the Divine Realm.

34:53.800 --> 34:54.989
We belong to this type.

34:56.320 --> 34:57.440
The other type of gods

34:58.000 --> 34:59.440
enters the world by transcending causality,

34:59.800 --> 35:01.920
experiencing birth, death, and all kinds of suffering,

35:02.070 --> 35:03.150
yet they remain unaffected by grief,

35:03.400 --> 35:06.360
resentment, jealousy, or hatred.

35:06.920 --> 35:08.480
They sever all obsession,

35:09.440 --> 35:11.280
refraining from listening, seeing,

35:11.630 --> 35:13.550
and longing,

35:13.920 --> 35:16.550
and with a heart of cessation, they cultivate the spirit of benefiting all beings,

35:16.860 --> 35:18.450
ultimately reaching complete enlightenment through suffering.

35:19.840 --> 35:22.070
Deity Taihe and the gods of the Thunder Division

35:22.150 --> 35:23.400
are all like this.

35:24.110 --> 35:25.720
In the past, I never understood

35:26.290 --> 35:28.080
why gods who reached enlightenment through suffering

35:28.320 --> 35:30.030
held higher status and power than those

35:30.110 --> 35:32.800
who achieved it through contribution.

35:34.880 --> 35:37.070
Now, I understand.

35:38.550 --> 35:40.550
Enduring countless tribulations without changing one's original intention,

35:40.920 --> 35:43.110
and without hatred, anger, or resentment,

35:44.720 --> 35:46.240
is truly difficult.

35:47.250 --> 35:48.040
At least,

35:49.070 --> 35:50.190
I cannot do it.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.400
Greetings, My Lords.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.840
Ji Tanyin, do you admit your crime?

36:39.920 --> 36:41.110
What crime do I have?

36:41.110 --> 36:42.630
As a god,

36:42.800 --> 36:44.440
you put personal matters before public duty,

36:44.440 --> 36:45.760
disobeyed orders,

36:45.960 --> 36:48.630
destroyed your divine bone, and abandoned your divine position,

36:48.880 --> 36:51.550
disregarding the safety of the Three Realms.

36:51.760 --> 36:53.360
Aren't these all crimes?

36:53.770 --> 36:54.920
I destroyed my divine bone

36:55.150 --> 36:56.880
because I was set up by Hannv.

36:57.130 --> 36:58.860
She revealed her divine power in the mortal realm without permission,

36:58.920 --> 37:00.150
deceived mortals into

37:00.150 --> 37:01.230
besieging Yuanzhong,

37:01.550 --> 37:03.280
and colluded with humans to imprison me.

37:03.550 --> 37:04.840
In order to escape,

37:04.920 --> 37:06.290
I had no choice but to destroy my divine bone.

37:07.030 --> 37:09.230
My Lords, I sincerely ask you to investigate this thoroughly.

37:10.070 --> 37:11.230
Hannv's actions

37:11.510 --> 37:12.790
were all carried out under our orders.

37:15.510 --> 37:16.320
Why?

37:16.800 --> 37:18.730
You descended to the mortal realm in the first place

37:18.840 --> 37:20.760
to search for the Divine Left Hand

37:20.760 --> 37:22.000
and revive Taihe.

37:22.320 --> 37:23.560
Since you were unwilling to do it,

37:23.870 --> 37:26.280
we had no choice but to let Hannv do it for you.

37:26.880 --> 37:27.800
But My Lords,

37:27.800 --> 37:29.320
you've promised me

37:29.590 --> 37:31.000
that I could take the Divine Hand after Yuanzhong

37:31.000 --> 37:32.150
lived out his natural life.

37:32.320 --> 37:33.800
I've been keeping my promise.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.550
How could you go back on your word?

37:35.710 --> 37:37.630
Things have changed.

37:38.480 --> 37:40.190
We agreed to your request back then

37:40.440 --> 37:41.990
because he had committed no grave offense,

37:42.010 --> 37:42.950
his sins did not warrant death,

37:43.360 --> 37:45.000
and you vouched for him with your life,

37:45.000 --> 37:46.880
though reluctantly.

37:47.070 --> 37:47.960
But now,

37:48.000 --> 37:49.440
he wants to destroy the world,

37:49.770 --> 37:51.850
and his demonic intent is plain to see.

37:52.230 --> 37:53.850
As a god,

37:53.960 --> 37:55.710
not only did you not punish him impartially,

37:55.710 --> 37:58.150
you even protected him out of personal feelings.

37:58.690 --> 38:00.690
If not for your repeated interference,

38:01.060 --> 38:02.950
he would have already perished

38:03.000 --> 38:06.630
and the Divine Hand would have returned to the Divine Realm long ago.

38:06.630 --> 38:08.880
And we wouldn't have to waste words today.

38:09.660 --> 38:10.750
My Lords, please allow me to explain.

38:11.480 --> 38:13.670
I have my reasons for what I did.

38:14.320 --> 38:15.670
You want to make excuses?

38:16.630 --> 38:17.920
I am not making excuses.

38:18.150 --> 38:18.920
In the mortal realm,

38:18.920 --> 38:20.320
I met a weapon spirit by chance.

38:20.440 --> 38:22.400
It was born from the divine lantern I created.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.070
During the war between gods and demons,

38:24.070 --> 38:24.880
he witnessed with his own eyes

38:24.880 --> 38:26.820
that Deity Taihe was actually the Demon Lord.

38:26.920 --> 38:27.590
In his fear,

38:27.590 --> 38:28.880
he fled the Heavenly Realm.

38:28.880 --> 38:29.840
Insolence!

38:30.320 --> 38:32.210
How could you believe the words

38:32.710 --> 38:34.320
of a mere weapon spirit?

38:34.920 --> 38:38.340
Deity Taihe was a Primordial God

38:39.360 --> 38:42.070
and had protected all beings for thousands of years.

38:42.150 --> 38:44.880
How dare you slander him here?

38:48.710 --> 38:49.510
Just because he made contributions,

38:49.510 --> 38:50.840
does that mean he doesn't make mistakes?

38:51.440 --> 38:52.440
The cause of the war between gods and demons

38:52.440 --> 38:53.710
was already quite suspicious.

38:53.800 --> 38:54.630
Since there is evidence,

38:54.710 --> 38:55.920
why can't we investigate it?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.190
Moreover,

38:57.320 --> 38:59.000
when I returned to the Heavenly Realm last time,

38:59.150 --> 39:00.440
Hannv obstructed me in every way

39:00.440 --> 39:01.800
from meeting you

39:02.110 --> 39:03.240
and even sealed the Ascension Platform,

39:03.260 --> 39:04.840
preventing my primordial spirit from returning.

39:05.000 --> 39:06.230
She was so apprehensive.

39:06.510 --> 39:07.280
Doesn't that

39:07.280 --> 39:08.510
make you suspect her?

39:09.110 --> 39:10.800
Nonsense!

39:11.030 --> 39:12.190
We are all clear

39:12.190 --> 39:13.710
about what Hannv is like.

39:14.070 --> 39:15.840
You protected your host in the mortal realm

39:15.870 --> 39:16.980
and disobeyed the orders.

39:17.230 --> 39:19.670
Hannv has said a lot of good things about you.

39:19.960 --> 39:20.800
As the divine official

39:20.800 --> 39:23.230
who guided you when you ascended,

39:23.800 --> 39:26.880
she not only taught you

39:26.900 --> 39:29.010
but has also treated you like a sister.

39:29.070 --> 39:31.710
Have you forgotten all of this?

39:31.710 --> 39:34.110
It's one thing that you are ungrateful,

39:34.130 --> 39:35.870
but now you're slandering her.

39:36.270 --> 39:38.060
Do you have no conscience?

39:59.710 --> 40:00.660
Goddess Wushuang,

40:00.880 --> 40:02.550
to revive Taihe,

40:02.630 --> 40:05.190
you risked your life crossing the Sea of Flux.

40:05.190 --> 40:06.620
That was a great merit.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.320
For this reason,

40:08.550 --> 40:10.190
we can overlook

40:10.190 --> 40:11.590
all your wrongdoings.

40:12.360 --> 40:13.550
But just now,

40:13.590 --> 40:14.670
I sensed that

40:14.690 --> 40:16.390
the Divine Hand has already left

40:16.420 --> 40:17.570
the host's body.

40:17.830 --> 40:20.460
So, you should hand it over,

40:20.760 --> 40:23.760
and I will help you regain your divine bone

40:24.030 --> 40:25.320
and restore your position in the celestial ranks.

40:26.280 --> 40:29.060
As for the things you are suspicious about,

40:29.150 --> 40:31.920
we can reinvestigate them

40:32.000 --> 40:33.440
and give you an explanation.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.670
Give it to us.

40:37.090 --> 40:40.010
The Divine Realm will not forget your contributions.

40:56.400 --> 40:57.190
How dare you!

41:02.230 --> 41:04.580
Although the gods of the Thunder Division have cold personalities,

41:04.940 --> 41:06.530
they have always been upright.

41:06.800 --> 41:07.510
They never lose their temper

41:07.510 --> 41:08.630
and harm others

41:08.630 --> 41:10.800
just because they are contradicted.

41:10.920 --> 41:12.230
Whenever there is doubt, they always investigate,

41:12.280 --> 41:13.360
and whenever they investigate, they do so thoroughly.

41:13.360 --> 41:15.070
They never avoid the issue or speak in circles.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.480
Most importantly,

41:16.880 --> 41:18.550
they would never

41:18.550 --> 41:19.800
be blinded by emotions.

41:20.800 --> 41:22.550
I know it's you, Hannv!

41:39.210 --> 41:40.890
I underestimated you.

41:44.510 --> 41:45.960
Where are the gods of the Thunder Division?

41:46.670 --> 41:48.070
Those old fellows

41:48.420 --> 41:50.700
do nothing but sit in meditation all day.

41:50.960 --> 41:53.070
With just a mere embroidery,

41:53.280 --> 41:54.840
I deceived their five senses

41:54.840 --> 41:56.360
and isolated them in the Discipline Hall.

41:56.850 --> 41:59.370
Now, everything they see and feel

41:59.440 --> 42:01.080
is an illusion created by the embroidery.

42:01.280 --> 42:02.840
By the time they notice something's wrong,

42:03.630 --> 42:05.510
it will already be too late.

42:09.130 --> 42:09.940
See?

42:10.400 --> 42:12.370
Even Mr. Loong was suppressed by me.

42:15.930 --> 42:18.000
Now, it's just you and me.

42:18.670 --> 42:20.590
If you still regard me as your sister,

42:21.710 --> 42:23.480
hand over the Divine Hand.

42:24.250 --> 42:25.520
The Divine Hand is with me.

42:25.540 --> 42:26.570
Where's Taihe?
